OL,3,GNEWSAEnd of an era for disabled
OL,4,Agymnastics competition
OL,5,
OL,6,FA gymnastic competition for people with
OL,7,Fdisabilities may have come to an end
OL,8,Fafter 26 years.
OL,10,FThe annual event welcomed competitors
OL,11,Ffrom across Europe to Poole, Dorset,
OL,12,Fover the weekend.
OL,14,FHowever, organisers Kay Salter MBE and
OL,15,FDave Balmer, both aged in their 80s,
OL,16,Fhave decided to step down.
OL,18,FBalmer said they were both "incredibly
OL,19,Fproud" to see the gymnasts' progress
OL,20,Fover the years and hoped the event
OL,21,Fwould continue under new leadership.
